§ `Part 7 -- vilification, victimisation, advertising`

#ASSERT `s 67A -- was I unlawfully vilified` `on the ground of race` TRUE TRUE `no defence of this kind` EQUALS `VILIFIED`
#ASSERT `s 67A -- was I unlawfully vilified` `on the ground of race` TRUE TRUE `it was a fair report of such an act` EQUALS `67A DEFENCE`
