#ASSERT `s 75 -- did they owe the positive duty on that day` `any business` TRUE FALSE `12 Apr 2027` EQUALS `DUTY APPLIES`
#ASSERT `s 75 -- did they owe the positive duty on that day` `government body` TRUE FALSE `11 Apr 2025` EQUALS `DUTY NOT YET`
#ASSERT `s 75 -- did they owe the positive duty on that day` `government body` TRUE FALSE `12 Apr 2025` EQUALS `DUTY APPLIES`
#ASSERT `s 75 -- did they owe the positive duty on that day` `government manager` TRUE FALSE `7 Nov 2026` EQUALS `DUTY APPLIES`
